(F5 T2 V4: element_interface_intpnt_direction (manual Professional 6.430),
 2D. Per interface integration point: normal, first tangential, second
 tangential = normal x first tangential (9 values). Element 1 along x:
 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1; element 2 along (0.6, 0.8): -0.8 0.6 0 0.6 0.8 0
 0 0 -1. The Professional 02-08-2026 does not write this record; its
 element_interface_direction (probe d2) holds the same vectors.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 0
node 4 1 0
node 5 0 2
node 6 0.6 2.8
node 7 0 2
node 8 0.6 2.8
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2 -quad4 5 6 7 8
group_type 0 -materi
group_interface 0 -yes
group_interface_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_interface_materi_elasti_stiffness 0 1.e3 1.e3
bounda_dof 10 -ra 1 2 5 6 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_time 10 0.
bounda_dof 20 -ra 3 4 7 8 -ra -velx
bounda_time 20 1.e-3
bounda_dof 21 -ra 3 4 7 8 -ra -vely
bounda_time 21 -1.e-3
control_timestep 10 0.1 1.0
end_data
